        <h2>Something not covered</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:book@saltlineretreats.co">book@saltlineretreats.co</a>
          and Tess will answer it herself, usually within two days. Questions
          about injuries, medication, anxiety about travelling alone and whether
          a particular week is the right one for you are all welcome, and the
          answer is sometimes that one of the other two would suit you
          better.</p>
        <p>There is no sales process here. Nobody will follow up, nobody will
          put you on a list, and an email asking a question is not treated as an
          enquiry to be converted.</p>
      </div>
